{"seq":2,"slug":"zone-signing-prepublication-rollover","title":"区签名与预发布/双签名密钥轮转机制（RFC 6781 / RFC 5011）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/zone-signing-key-ops/zone-signing-prepublication-rollover","wordCount":2581,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"区签名与预发布-双签名密钥轮转机制-rfc-6781-rfc-5011\">区签名与预发布/双签名密钥轮转机制（RFC 6781 / RFC 5011）</h1><p>换一把 ZSK 看起来只是&quot;生成新密钥、重新签名&quot;，但只要跨越缓存，就会有一段时间解析器手里同时存在<strong>旧 DNSKEY 与新 RRSIG</strong>、或<strong>新 DNSKEY 而没有对应 RRSIG</strong>。任何中间态处理不当，都会让本该有效的应答被判为 Bogus。RFC 6781 §4.1 给出的两套 ZSK 方案（Pre-Publish、Double-Signature）与两套 KSK 方案（Double-KSK、Double-DS），本质上是<strong>用不同的时间线安排，保证每一次缓存视角下的状态都自洽</strong>；RFC 5011 又把 KSK 轮换拉长到解析器侧的 30 天保持期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预发布-双签名-与-ksk-的特殊路径\">核心概念：预发布、双签名，与 KSK 的特殊路径</h2><p><strong>ZSK 预发布（Pre-Publish，RFC 6781 §4.1.1.1）</strong> 的四个阶段是 <code>initial → new DNSKEY → new RRSIGs → DNSKEY removal</code>。关键动作：先把新 ZSK 的公钥放进 DNSKEY RRset，但<strong>暂时不用它签业务记录</strong>。等&quot;只有公钥、没有签名&quot;的时间超过一个 TTL 周期（RFC 6781 表述为&quot;数据传播到所有权威服务器的时间 + key set 的 TTL&quot;，后续阶段再加&quot;上一版区带中任意数据的最大区带 TTL&quot;），缓存里已普遍持有新公钥，此时才切换 RRSIG 用新 ZSK 签，旧公钥再留一个周期移除。整个过程里，验证者要用的公钥<strong>总是先于</strong>它需要的签名出现。</p>\n<p><strong>ZSK 双签名（§4.1.1.2）</strong> 只有三个阶段 <code>initial → new DNSKEY → DNSKEY removal</code>：新旧两把 ZSK 私钥都可用，全部业务 RRset 同时用两把密钥各签一条 RRSIG。等待期只需&quot;传播延迟 + 版本 0 区带的最大区带 TTL&quot;。代价 RFC 6781 写得很直白：<strong>轮换期间区带里的签名数量翻倍</strong>，对大型区带意味着签名体积、传输量与验证开销同步翻倍。</p>\n<p><strong>KSK 不能照搬 ZSK 方案</strong>，因为它的信任不来自本区带的 DNSKEY，而来自<strong>父区带里那条 DS 记录</strong>——父区不在你手里，DS 更新有注册延迟（<code>Dreg</code>），父区 TTL 也不受你控制。RFC 6781 §4.1.2 因此给出两条路径：<strong>Double-KSK</strong> 让本区先同时发布新旧两把 KSK、DNSKEY RRset 由两把密钥各签一条，等传播完成父区把 DS 从旧换成新，再等 <code>TTL_DS</code> 确保旧 DS 从父区缓存过期，最后移除旧 KSK；<strong>Double-DS</strong> 则是先让父区同时发布两条 DS，本区再换 KSK，最后撤旧 DS。</p>\n<p>RFC 6781 明确<strong>更推荐 Double-KSK</strong>：Double-DS 在第一段重叠期里，新 DS 指向的 DNSKEY 还没发布，区带处于临时 &quot;security-lame&quot; 状态，且新 DS 的验证无法通过 DNS 自检，需要两次子区—父区交互。对托管 DNS 服务商尤其关键——多一次工单交互就是一个运维失败点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>阶段数</th>\n<th>关键等待量</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pre-Publish</td>\n<td>ZSK</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>传播延迟 + key set TTL（+ 最大区带 TTL）</td>\n<td>时间最长，需四步编排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Double-Signature</td>\n<td>ZSK</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>传播延迟 + 版本 0 最大区带 TTL</td>\n<td>签名数量翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Double-KSK</td>\n<td>KSK</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>Dreg</code> + <code>TTL_DS</code></td>\n<td>父区需两次交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Double-DS</td>\n<td>KSK</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>Dreg</code> + <code>TTL_DS</code></td>\n<td>临时 security-lame，无法 DNS 自检</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时间参数模型-把-等多久-写成可计算的公式\">时间参数模型：把&quot;等多久&quot;写成可计算的公式</h2><p>RFC 7583 把 RFC 6781 的散落表述收敛成一组符号与方程，这是自动化签名器直接落地的依据。四个基本量：<code>Dprp</code>（传播延迟，master 变更到达所有 slave 的时间）、<code>Dreg</code>（注册延迟，DS 提交到父区后出现的耗时）、<code>Dsgn</code>（新 ZSK 引入后签完全部区带 RR 的时间）、<code>TTLkey</code> / <code>TTLsig</code> / <code>TTLds</code>（DNSKEY、RRSIG、DS 的 TTL）。</p>\n<p><strong>ZSK 预发布的发布/退役间隔</strong>（RFC 7583 §3.2.1）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{pub} = D_{prp} + TTL_{key}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{ret} = D_{sgn} + D_{prp} + TTL_{sig}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>Ipub</code> 是&quot;新 DNSKEY 发布后，多久可假定缓存已普遍含有它&quot;；<code>Iret</code> 是&quot;旧密钥退役后，依赖它的信息（RRSIG）多久从缓存彻底清除&quot;。生效必须晚于就绪：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{act}(N) \\ge T_{rdy}(N) = T_{pub}(N) + I_{pub}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>ZSK 双签名的退役间隔不同</strong>（§3.2.2），因为它要同时等公钥与签名的缓存清除：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{ret} = D_{sgn} + D_{prp} + \\max(TTL_{key},\\ TTL_{sig})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <code>max</code> 而非求和，正是双签名能缩短轮换总周期的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>KSK 侧的关键差异</strong>在于出现 <code>Dreg</code> 与父区 TTL。Double-KSK（§3.3.1）中子区发布间隔 <code>IpubC = DprpC + TTLkey</code>，但<strong>退役间隔由父区决定</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{ret} = D_{prpP} + TTL_{ds}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">pP</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；Double-DS（§3.3.2）反过来——子区侧退役间隔 <code>Iret = DprpC + TTLkey</code>，发布侧要等父区 DS 生效 <code>IpubP = DprpP + TTLds</code>。<strong>这两个公式的对称互换，就是两套 KSK 方案的数学差异</strong>：一个把等待压在父区（DS 必须过期），一个压在子区（DNSKEY 必须过期）。</p>\n<p>工程含义很直接：<strong>区带越大、<code>TTLsig</code> 越长，<code>Iret</code> 越大，轮换总周期越长</strong>。<code>TTLsig</code> 设为 7 天的区带，配合 <code>Dsgn</code> 与传播延迟，单次预发布轮换很容易拉到两三周——签名有效期直接抬高了每次轮换的下限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逐阶段时间线与易错点\">逐阶段时间线与易错点</h2><p>把公式串成时间线：ZSK 预发布由 <code>Tpub(N)</code> 发布新公钥 → 经 <code>Ipub</code> 到达 <code>Trdy(N)</code> → <code>Tact(N)</code> 起改用新 ZSK 签名 → 旧 ZSK 在 <code>Tret(N) = Tact(N) + Lzsk</code> 退役（<code>Lzsk</code> 为 ZSK 生命周期）→ 经 <code>Iret</code> 在 <code>Tdea(N)</code> 完全可弃 → <code>Trem(N) &gt;= Tdea(N)</code> 才能删除密钥文件。RFC 7583 §3.2.1 给出上界 <code>Tpub(N+1) &lt;= Tact(N) + Lzsk - Ipub</code>，即<strong>下一把 ZSK 的发布必须留够 <code>Ipub</code> 余量</strong>，否则两次轮换重叠冲突。KSK 在 Double-KSK 下多出 <code>Dreg</code>：<code>Tsbm(N) &gt;= Trdy(N)</code> 是提交 DS 的最早时刻，<code>Tact(N) = Tsbm(N) + Dreg</code>，而 <code>Tret(N) = Tsbm(N+1) + Dreg</code> 依赖<strong>下一次</strong>提交时刻。RFC 6781 §4.1.2.1 补充：使用 RFC 5011 跟踪时，撤旧 KSK <strong>必须再发布一个最大区带 TTL 的时长并置 REVOKE 位</strong>，且该密钥必须自签那一版 DNSKEY RRset。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rfc-5011-解析器侧的独立时间线\">RFC 5011：解析器侧的独立时间线</h2><p>上面所有公式都是&quot;签名侧&quot;的。若解析器启用 RFC 5011 自动信任锚更新，就会被叠加一条<strong>由解析器掌控、运营方无法加速的时间线</strong>。状态机：<strong>Start → AddPend</strong> 是解析器在一个<strong>已验证</strong>的 DNSKEY RRset 中看到带 SEP 位的新密钥；<strong>AddPend → Valid</strong> 需经过 add hold-down，RFC 5011 规定它是 <strong>30 天或首次包含该密钥的信任点 DNSKEY RRset 原始 TTL 到期时间，取较长者</strong>，且解析器<strong>必须至少观察到两次包含该密钥的有效 DNSKEY RRset</strong> 才可接受；<strong>Valid → Missing</strong> 表示该密钥在最近一次验证的 RRset 中消失但<strong>仍是有效信任锚</strong>，重现即回到 Valid；<strong>任意状态 → Revoked</strong> 由带 REVOKE 位（RFC 5011 §3 定义为 DNSKEY Flags 的 bit 8）、且自签该 RRset 的密钥触发，<strong>撤销即时且永久</strong>；<strong>Revoked → Removed</strong> 需再过 30 天 remove hold-down。</p>\n<p>两个必须内化的后果。<strong>第一，&quot;发布&quot;不等于&quot;被信任&quot;</strong>：新 KSK 发出后还要等解析器走完 30 天保持期加两次观察，它才真正被接受；这段时间新 KSK 只是备选，旧 KSK 必须继续有效。RFC 7583 §3.3.4 折算成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{pubC} \\ge D_{prpC} + \\max(I_{trp},\\ TTL_{key})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">pC</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{trp} \\ge AddHoldDownTime + 2 \\times modifiedQueryInterval</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>modifiedQueryInterval = MAX(1hr, MIN(15 days, TTLkey/2))</code>。代入 30 天，<code>Itrp</code> 至少是 30 天加两个查询间隔——<strong>这就是&quot;KSK 轮换以月计&quot;的算术来源</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，解析器有容量约束</strong>：RFC 5011 要求合规解析器<strong>每个信任点至少能管理 5 把 SEP 密钥</strong>，限制了轮换时能堆积的新旧密钥数量。刷新节奏也被固定：<code>queryInterval = MAX(1hr, MIN(15 days, 1/2*OrigTTL, 1/2*RRSigExpirationInterval))</code>，失败重试 <code>retryTime = MAX(1hr, MIN(1 day, .1*origTTL, .1*expireInterval))</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Start[Start] --&gt;|NewKey: 已验证 DNSKEY RRset 中&lt;br/&gt;见到带 SEP 位的新密钥| AddPend[AddPend]&#10;    AddPend --&gt;|AddTime: 30 天或首个 TTL 到期&lt;br/&gt;且至少两次有效观察| Valid[Valid]&#10;    AddPend --&gt;|KeyRem| Start&#10;    Valid --&gt;|KeyRem| Missing[Missing: 仍是有效锚点]&#10;    Missing --&gt;|KeyPres| Valid&#10;    Valid --&gt;|RevBit: REVOKE 位自签| Revoked[Revoked: 永久失效]&#10;    Missing --&gt;|RevBit| Revoked&#10;    Revoked --&gt;|RemTime: 30 天| Removed[Removed]\">graph TD\n    Start[Start] --&gt;|NewKey: 已验证 DNSKEY RRset 中&lt;br/&gt;见到带 SEP 位的新密钥| AddPend[AddPend]\n    AddPend --&gt;|AddTime: 30 天或首个 TTL 到期&lt;br/&gt;且至少两次有效观察| Valid[Valid]\n    AddPend --&gt;|KeyRem| Start\n    Valid --&gt;|KeyRem| Missing[Missing: 仍是有效锚点]\n    Missing --&gt;|KeyPres| Valid\n    Valid --&gt;|RevBit: REVOKE 位自签| Revoked[Revoked: 永久失效]\n    Missing --&gt;|RevBit| Revoked\n    Revoked --&gt;|RemTime: 30 天| Removed[Removed]</pre><h2 id=\"落地形态-自动化-真实根区案例与配置策略\">落地形态：自动化、真实根区案例与配置策略</h2><p><strong>谁能自动化。</strong> RFC 6781 §4.1.5 的结论至今成立：ZSK 轮换容易自动化，因为只涉及子区；KSK 轮换需父子交互，是自动化链条上最难的一段。RFC 8078 的 CDS/CDNSKEY 记录配合 RFC 7344 的处理规则，让子区可把自己想要的 DS 内容直接发布出去、父区自动读取更新，这条路径已能自动完成 KSK 的 DS 变更。</p>\n<p><strong>真实根区是活教材。</strong> IANA 根锚点文件 <code>root-anchors.xml</code> 中同时列着三把 KSK：Key Tag <strong>19036</strong>（算法 8 / RSASHA256，2010-07-15 至 2019-01-11，已退役）、<strong>20326</strong>（算法 8，2017-02-02 起，<strong>当前有效</strong>）、<strong>38696</strong>（算法 8，2024-07-18 起，<strong>作为下一次轮换已提前发布</strong>）。KSK 38696 正是一个处于 Pre-Publish 布置阶段的新密钥——已在信任锚文件中就位，等待 RFC 5011 保持期与后续 REVOKE 流程。IANA 也公布 <strong>Root KSK Ceremony 63 定于 2026-11-12</strong>，用途是签署 2027 年第一季度的 ZSK。即使是自动化程度最高的根区，KSK 的物理仪式与 ZSK 的季度轮换仍是两条节奏完全不同的工作流。</p>\n<p><strong>把状态机交给软件，或走紧急路径。</strong> BIND 9 的 <code>dnssec-policy</code> 把上述阶段抽象成由签名器自己驱动的目标状态，运维方只声明密钥生命周期与安全余量。其内置 <code>default</code> 策略是一把<strong>永不更换的 CSK</strong>、算法 <code>ECDSAP256SHA256</code>；<code>standard</code> 策略示例则声明 <code>ksk lifetime 365d; zsk lifetime 60d; algorithm ecdsap256sha256;</code> 并配 <code>publish-safety 7d;</code> 与 <code>retire-safety 7d;</code>——<strong>这两个词就是 RFC 7583 的 <code>Ipub</code> / <code>Iret</code> 在实现里的名字</strong>。<code>default</code> 永不换 CSK 是刻意选择：把 KSK 轮换的跨组织成本归零，代价是放弃密钥分离的隔离收益。另一条路径是 RFC 6781 §4.2 的<strong>紧急轮换</strong>（KSK/ZSK 泄露、锚点泄露、备用密钥），它不能等 TTL 过期，必须尽量缩短暴露窗口，代价是可能接受短暂服务降级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ZSK 两条路径：<strong>Pre-Publish</strong>（先发公钥、后换签名，四阶段，最安全也最慢）与 <strong>Double-Signature</strong>（新旧同签，三阶段，等待短但签名量翻倍）；KSK 两条路径：<strong>Double-KSK</strong>（父区换 DS，RFC 6781 推荐）与 <strong>Double-DS</strong>（父区双 DS，短暂 security-lame）。共同不变式是<strong>公钥总是先于对应签名出现</strong>。</li>\n<li>RFC 7583 量化等待：ZSK 预发布 <code>Ipub = Dprp + TTLkey</code>、<code>Iret = Dsgn + Dprp + TTLsig</code>；KSK 的 <code>Iret</code> 与 <code>Ipub</code> 在两套方案间对称互换，决定轮换总周期。</li>\n<li>RFC 5011 叠加解析器侧时间线：add hold-down <strong>30 天或首个 TTL 到期取较长者</strong>、<strong>至少两次有效观察</strong>、remove hold-down <strong>30 天</strong>、REVOKE 位撤销<strong>即时且永久</strong>，每信任点至少管理 5 把 SEP 密钥。</li>\n<li>真实根区演示 Pre-Publish 布置：KSK <strong>20326</strong> 当前有效、KSK <strong>38696</strong>（2024-07-18 起）已提前发布待用，IANA 定于 <strong>2026-11-12</strong> 举行 Root KSK Ceremony 63。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>密钥角色划分与 SEP 标志位语义见同 hub 的 <a href=\"ksk-zsk-csk-key-hierarchy\">KSK/ZSK/CSK 密钥分层与签名职责模型</a>；RRSIG 三元组如何解析到具体 DNSKEY，见 <a href=\"../dnssec-cryptographic-chain/dnssec-record-model-rrsig-dnskey-ds\">DNSSEC 记录模型：RRSIG / DNSKEY / DS</a>；RFC 5011 在验证器侧的完整状态机，见 <a href=\"../dnssec-cryptographic-chain/chain-of-trust-anchor-verification\">信任链与信任锚验证</a>。数据来源：RFC 6781、RFC 7583、RFC 5011、IANA <code>root-anchors.xml</code> 与 IANA DNSSEC 页面（Root KSK Ceremony 63）、BIND 9 ARM <code>dnssec-policy</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"区签名与预发布/双签名密钥轮转机制（RFC 6781 / RFC 5011）","id":"区签名与预发布-双签名密钥轮转机制-rfc-6781-rfc-5011"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预发布、双签名，与 KSK 的特殊路径","id":"核心概念-预发布-双签名-与-ksk-的特殊路径"},{"level":2,"text":"时间参数模型：把\"等多久\"写成可计算的公式","id":"时间参数模型-把-等多久-写成可计算的公式"},{"level":2,"text":"逐阶段时间线与易错点","id":"逐阶段时间线与易错点"},{"level":2,"text":"RFC 5011：解析器侧的独立时间线","id":"rfc-5011-解析器侧的独立时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"落地形态：自动化、真实根区案例与配置策略","id":"落地形态-自动化-真实根区案例与配置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"KSK/ZSK/CSK 密钥分层与签名职责模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/zone-signing-key-ops/ksk-zsk-csk-key-hierarchy"},"next":{"title":"密钥生成仪式、HSM 离线签名与密钥策略合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/zone-signing-key-ops/key-ceremony-hsm-offline-signing"}}